      "id": "hbm-20260929",
      "date": "2026-09-29",
      "title": {
        "en": "TrendForce raises its 2027 high-bandwidth memory price forecast",
        "zh": "TrendForce 上调 2027 年高带宽内存价格预测"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "TrendForce forecasts a 121% year-on-year increase in the blended average selling price of high-bandwidth memory (HBM) in 2027, reflecting supply constraints and a changing product mix. This is a forecast, not a realized price.",
        "zh": "TrendForce 预测 2027 年高带宽内存（HBM）混合平均售价同比上涨 121%，原因包括供应受限及产品组合变化。这是预测，并非已实现价格。"
      },
      "sourceId": "trendforce-hbm-20260929"
    },
    {
      "id": "alibaba-ai-storage-20260929",
      "date": "2026-09-29",
      "title": {
        "en": "Alibaba Cloud details five storage products for AI workloads",
        "zh": "阿里云披露五项面向 AI 负载的存储产品"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Alibaba Cloud's Apsara 2026 portfolio includes KVCacheStore, OSS Tables, CPFS, AgenticFS and enhanced EBS. The company states that its new CPFS supports up to 100 PiB per filesystem and reports a 69% reduction in AI storage costs; these are vendor-reported product claims, not market-wide results.",
        "zh": "阿里云在 2026 云栖大会发布的产品组合包括 KVCacheStore、OSS Tables、CPFS、AgenticFS 及增强型 EBS。公司称新一代 CPFS 单文件系统最高支持 100 PiB，并可降低 69% 的 AI 存储成本；这些属于厂商披露的产品指标，并非全市场统计结果。"
      },
      "sourceId": "alibaba-ai-storage-20260929"
    },
    {
