      "summary": {
        "en": "CXMT reports an 11.95 nm active-area half-pitch and 24 Gb LPDDR5X dies. Half-pitch is a specific measurement, not the size of every structure on the chip.",
        "zh": "长鑫披露有源区半节距 11.95 nm，并推出单裸片 24 Gb 的 LPDDR5X。半节距是具体测量指标，不代表芯片所有结构的尺寸。"
      },
      "sourceId": "cxmt-g5"
    },
